  (limit 8 N) that only integrates near the target. Sim with identified friction:
  steps settle 0.06-0.38 mm, windup jump after a held 15 N push 0.09 mm
  (unconditional: 7 mm), hold/reach test reach error 0.11 mm (was 2.2 mm).
